abstract: >-
  Research code and existing descriptive results for evaluating the semantic
  consistency of large language models on reasoner-certified OWL contexts.
  Ontology-derived data retain their upstream licenses. HPO-derived contexts
  and raw/validated predictions are withheld pending redistribution clarification.
  Historical regression outputs are excluded evidence.
keywords:
  - OWL
  - ontology
  - large language models
  - semantic consistency
  - explanation validation
